{"seq":1,"slug":"r-for-research","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — R 语言科研应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/software-tools/r-for-research","wordCount":1954,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-科研统计方法-r-语言科研应用\">研究生 科研统计方法 — R 语言科研应用</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>R 语言从诞生之日起就扎根于统计学和数据分析领域，经过三十余年的发展，已经形成了一个覆盖几乎所有统计方法的庞大生态系统。对于刚进入研究生阶段的自学者来说，掌握 R 语言不仅意味着拥有一把打开统计分析大门的钥匙，更意味着能够融入全球最活跃的科研社区之一。本节将从 R 生态系统的全景视角出发，带你建立从数据处理到可视化、从模型构建到可重复研究的完整技能链。</p>\n<p>核心知识点包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>R 生态系统架构</strong>：CRAN（综合 R 档案网络）拥有超过 20,000 个软件包，Bioconductor 专注于生物信息学领域，提供 2,000+ 专业包</li>\n<li><strong>tidyverse 数据整理流</strong>：以 dplyr、tidyr、readr、stringr 为核心的现代数据操作范式</li>\n<li><strong>ggplot2 可视化语法</strong>：基于图形语法（Grammar of Graphics）的分层绑定式绑定系统</li>\n<li><strong>关键统计建模包</strong>：lme4（混合效应模型）、lavaan（结构方程模型）、brms（贝叶斯回归模型）</li>\n<li><strong>RMarkdown 可重复研究</strong>：将代码、结果和文字融合为一体的科研报告方案</li>\n<li><strong>renv 包管理</strong>：锁定项目依赖版本，确保分析结果可复现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"r-生态系统全景\">R 生态系统全景</h3><p>R 的软件包生态是其最大竞争优势。理解这个生态系统的结构，能帮助你快速找到所需工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仓库</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>包数量</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CRAN</td>\n<td>通用统计与数据科学</td>\n<td>20,000+</td>\n<td>回归分析、时间序列、机器学习</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bioconductor</td>\n<td>生物信息学</td>\n<td>2,200+</td>\n<td>基因组分析、蛋白质组学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub</td>\n<td>开发版/实验性包</td>\n<td>不计其数</td>\n<td>前沿方法、尚未提交 CRAN 的工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R-universe</td>\n<td>个人/团队仓库</td>\n<td>增长中</td>\n<td>自定义包分发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>安装包的基本方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"install.packages(&quot;tidyverse&quot;)&#10;&#10;if (!require(&quot;BiocManager&quot;, quietly = TRUE))&#10;    install.packages(&quot;BiocManager&quot;)&#10;BiocManager::install(&quot;DESeq2&quot;)&#10;&#10;remotes::install_github(&quot;author/package&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>install.packages(\"tidyverse\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (!require(\"BiocManager\", quietly = TRUE))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    install.packages(\"BiocManager\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BiocManager::install(\"DESeq2\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>remotes::install_github(\"author/package\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tidyverse-数据整理流\">tidyverse 数据整理流</h3><p>tidyverse 是一系列共享设计哲学的包集合，其核心思想是&quot;整洁数据&quot;（tidy data）——每个变量一列，每个观测一行，每种观测类型一张表。</p>\n<p><strong>dplyr：数据操作的瑞士军刀</strong></p>\n<p>dplyr 提供了五个核心动词，几乎覆盖了所有数据操作需求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(tidyverse)&#10;&#10;survey_data &lt;- read_csv(&quot;survey_results.csv&quot;)&#10;&#10;cleaned &lt;- survey_data %&gt;%&#10;  filter(!is.na(response_time), age &gt;= 18) %&gt;%&#10;  mutate(&#10;    log_rt = log(response_time),&#10;    age_group = case_when(&#10;      age &lt; 30 ~ &quot;青年&quot;,&#10;      age &lt; 50 ~ &quot;中年&quot;,&#10;      TRUE ~ &quot;老年&quot;&#10;    )&#10;  ) %&gt;%&#10;  group_by(age_group, condition) %&gt;%&#10;  summarise(&#10;    mean_rt = mean(log_rt),&#10;    sd_rt = sd(log_rt),&#10;    n = n(),&#10;    .groups = &quot;drop&quot;&#10;  )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(tidyverse)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>survey_data &#x3C;- read_csv(\"survey_results.csv\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cleaned &#x3C;- survey_data %>%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter(!is.na(response_time), age >= 18) %>%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log_rt = log(response_time),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    age_group = case_when(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      age &#x3C; 30 ~ \"青年\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      age &#x3C; 50 ~ \"中年\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      TRUE ~ \"老年\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) %>%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group_by(age_group, condition) %>%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  summarise(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mean_rt = mean(log_rt),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sd_rt = sd(log_rt),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    n = n(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .groups = \"drop\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>tidyr：数据重塑</strong></p>\n<p>科研数据经常需要在宽格式和长格式之间转换。问卷数据、重复测量数据尤其如此：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"wide_data &lt;- tibble(&#10;  subject = 1:5,&#10;  pre_score = c(65, 72, 58, 80, 71),&#10;  post_score = c(78, 85, 69, 88, 82)&#10;)&#10;&#10;long_data &lt;- wide_data %&gt;%&#10;  pivot_longer(&#10;    cols = c(pre_score, post_score),&#10;    names_to = &quot;time_point&quot;,&#10;    values_to = &quot;score&quot;,&#10;    names_pattern = &quot;(.+)_score&quot;&#10;  )&#10;&#10;result &lt;- long_data %&gt;%&#10;  pivot_wider(&#10;    names_from = time_point,&#10;    values_from = score&#10;  )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>wide_data &#x3C;- tibble(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  subject = 1:5,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pre_score = c(65, 72, 58, 80, 71),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  post_score = c(78, 85, 69, 88, 82)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>long_data &#x3C;- wide_data %>%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pivot_longer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cols = c(pre_score, post_score),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    names_to = \"time_point\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    values_to = \"score\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    names_pattern = \"(.+)_score\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result &#x3C;- long_data %>%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pivot_wider(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    names_from = time_point,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    values_from = score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ggplot2-可视化语法\">ggplot2 可视化语法</h3><p>ggplot2 基于 Leland Wilkinson 的《图形语法》理论，将图表分解为数据、映射、几何对象、统计变换、坐标系和分面六个层次。这种分层结构让你能通过叠加组件来构建任意复杂的图形。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"ggplot(cleaned, aes(x = age_group, y = mean_rt, fill = condition)) +&#10;  geom_col(position = position_dodge(width = 0.8), width = 0.7) +&#10;  geom_errorbar(&#10;    aes(ymin = mean_rt - sd_rt, ymax = mean_rt + sd_rt),&#10;    position = position_dodge(width = 0.8),&#10;    width = 0.25&#10;  ) +&#10;  scale_fill_brewer(palette = &quot;Set2&quot;) +&#10;  labs(&#10;    title = &quot;不同年龄组的平均反应时&quot;,&#10;    x = &quot;年龄组&quot;,&#10;    y = &quot;对数反应时 (log ms)&quot;,&#10;    fill = &quot;实验条件&quot;&#10;  ) +&#10;  theme_minimal(base_size = 14) +&#10;  theme(legend.position = &quot;bottom&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ggplot(cleaned, aes(x = age_group, y = mean_rt, fill = condition)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_col(position = position_dodge(width = 0.8), width = 0.7) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_errorbar(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    aes(ymin = mean_rt - sd_rt, ymax = mean_rt + sd_rt),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    position = position_dodge(width = 0.8),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    width = 0.25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  scale_fill_brewer(palette = \"Set2\") +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  labs(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    title = \"不同年龄组的平均反应时\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x = \"年龄组\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y = \"对数反应时 (log ms)\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fill = \"实验条件\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme_minimal(base_size = 14) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme(legend.position = \"bottom\")</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ggplot2 的扩展包同样丰富：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扩展包</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ggpubr</td>\n<td>快速生成发表级图表，自动添加统计标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>patchwork</td>\n<td>多图拼接布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ggridges</td>\n<td>山脊图（密度分布比较）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ggalluvial</td>\n<td>冲积图（分类流转可视化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gganimate</td>\n<td>动态动画图表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ggrepel</td>\n<td>智能文本标签避让</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"关键统计建模包\">关键统计建模包</h3><p><strong>lme4：混合效应模型</strong></p>\n<p>当数据存在嵌套结构（如学生嵌套在班级中，试次嵌套在被试中）时，普通线性模型不再适用。混合效应模型通过引入随机效应来处理这种层次依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(lme4)&#10;&#10;model &lt;- lmer(&#10;  score ~ treatment * time + (1 + time | subject) + (1 | school),&#10;  data = longitudinal_data&#10;)&#10;&#10;summary(model)&#10;&#10;library(lmerTest)&#10;anova(model, type = 3)&#10;&#10;confint(model, method = &quot;boot&quot;, nsim = 1000)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(lme4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model &#x3C;- lmer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  score ~ treatment * time + (1 + time | subject) + (1 | school),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = longitudinal_data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summary(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(lmerTest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>anova(model, type = 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>confint(model, method = \"boot\", nsim = 1000)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模型公式中，<code>(1 + time | subject)</code> 表示每个被试有自己的截距和时间斜率，<code>(1 | school)</code> 表示学校间截距不同。</p>\n<p><strong>lavaan：结构方程模型</strong></p>\n<p>lavaan 用简洁的模型语法描述潜变量之间的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(lavaan)&#10;&#10;model_syntax &lt;- &#39;&#10;  # 测量模型&#10;  anxiety =~ anx1 + anx2 + anx3 + anx4&#10;  depression =~ dep1 + dep2 + dep3 + dep4&#10;  wellbeing =~ wb1 + wb2 + wb3&#10;&#10;  # 结构模型&#10;  wellbeing ~ anxiety + depression&#10;  depression ~ anxiety&#10;&#39;&#10;&#10;fit &lt;- sem(model_syntax, data = mental_health_data)&#10;summary(fit, fit.measures = TRUE, standardized = TRUE)&#10;&#10;fitMeasures(fit, c(&quot;cfi&quot;, &quot;tli&quot;, &quot;rmsea&quot;, &quot;srmr&quot;))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(lavaan)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model_syntax &#x3C;- '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 测量模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  anxiety =~ anx1 + anx2 + anx3 + anx4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  depression =~ dep1 + dep2 + dep3 + dep4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  wellbeing =~ wb1 + wb2 + wb3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 结构模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  wellbeing ~ anxiety + depression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  depression ~ anxiety</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fit &#x3C;- sem(model_syntax, data = mental_health_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summary(fit, fit.measures = TRUE, standardized = TRUE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fitMeasures(fit, c(\"cfi\", \"tli\", \"rmsea\", \"srmr\"))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>brms：贝叶斯回归模型</strong></p>\n<p>brms 以 lme4 式的公式语法调用 Stan 进行贝叶斯推断，大大降低了贝叶斯建模的门槛：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(brms)&#10;&#10;bayes_model &lt;- brm(&#10;  score ~ treatment * time + (1 + time | subject),&#10;  data = longitudinal_data,&#10;  family = gaussian(),&#10;  prior = c(&#10;    prior(normal(0, 10), class = &quot;b&quot;),&#10;    prior(cauchy(0, 2), class = &quot;sd&quot;)&#10;  ),&#10;  chains = 4,&#10;  iter = 4000,&#10;  warmup = 1000,&#10;  cores = 4&#10;)&#10;&#10;summary(bayes_model)&#10;plot(bayes_model)&#10;hypothesis(bayes_model, &quot;treatmentactive &gt; 0&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(brms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>bayes_model &#x3C;- brm(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  score ~ treatment * time + (1 + time | subject),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = longitudinal_data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  family = gaussian(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prior = c(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prior(normal(0, 10), class = \"b\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prior(cauchy(0, 2), class = \"sd\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  chains = 4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  iter = 4000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  warmup = 1000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cores = 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summary(bayes_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plot(bayes_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hypothesis(bayes_model, \"treatmentactive > 0\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"rmarkdown-可重复研究\">RMarkdown 可重复研究</h3><p>RMarkdown 将 Markdown 文本与 R 代码块融合，一次编译即可生成 PDF、HTML 或 Word 格式的完整报告。这是实现&quot;可重复研究&quot;（reproducible research）的核心工具。</p>\n<p>一份典型的 RMarkdown 文档结构如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# ---&#10;# title: &quot;实验一：认知负荷对决策质量的影响&quot;&#10;# author: &quot;张三&quot;&#10;# date: &quot;`r Sys.Date()`&quot;&#10;# output:&#10;#   pdf_document:&#10;#     latex_engine: xelatex&#10;#   html_document:&#10;#     toc: true&#10;# bibliography: references.bib&#10;# ---&#10;&#10;# 在代码块中直接运行分析&#10;library(tidyverse)&#10;library(lme4)&#10;&#10;data &lt;- read_csv(&quot;experiment1_data.csv&quot;)&#10;model &lt;- lmer(accuracy ~ load * strategy + (1 | subject), data = data)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># title: \"实验一：认知负荷对决策质量的影响\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># author: \"张三\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># date: \"`r Sys.Date()`\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># output:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   pdf_document:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     latex_engine: xelatex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   html_document:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     toc: true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># bibliography: references.bib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># ---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 在代码块中直接运行分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(tidyverse)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(lme4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data &#x3C;- read_csv(\"experiment1_data.csv\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model &#x3C;- lmer(accuracy ~ load * strategy + (1 | subject), data = data)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>搭配 <code>papaja</code> 包可以直接生成 APA 格式的学术论文，包括标准化的表格和图表格式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"renv-包管理\">renv 包管理</h3><p>科研项目的可复现性不仅要求代码可运行，还要求依赖环境完全一致。renv 为每个项目创建独立的包库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"renv::init()&#10;&#10;renv::snapshot()&#10;&#10;renv::restore()&#10;&#10;renv::status()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>renv::init()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>renv::snapshot()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>renv::restore()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>renv::status()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>工作流推荐：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>项目初始化时执行 <code>renv::init()</code></li>\n<li>每次安装或更新包后执行 <code>renv::snapshot()</code></li>\n<li>将 <code>renv.lock</code> 纳入版本控制（Git）</li>\n<li>合作者只需执行 <code>renv::restore()</code> 即可还原完整环境</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"常见科研工作流模式\">常见科研工作流模式</h3><p>一个完整的 R 科研分析项目通常遵循以下目录结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"project/&#10;├── data/&#10;│   ├── raw/           # 原始数据（只读）&#10;│   └── processed/     # 清洗后的数据&#10;├── R/&#10;│   ├── 01_clean.R     # 数据清洗&#10;│   ├── 02_explore.R   # 探索性分析&#10;│   ├── 03_model.R     # 统计建模&#10;│   └── 04_visualize.R # 可视化&#10;├── output/&#10;│   ├── figures/       # 图表&#10;│   └── tables/        # 表格&#10;├── manuscript/&#10;│   └── paper.Rmd      # RMarkdown 论文&#10;├── renv.lock          # 依赖锁文件&#10;└── README.md\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>project/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── data/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── raw/           # 原始数据（只读）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── processed/     # 清洗后的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── R/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 01_clean.R     # 数据清洗</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 02_explore.R   # 探索性分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 03_model.R     # 统计建模</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── 04_visualize.R # 可视化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── output/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── figures/       # 图表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── tables/        # 表格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── manuscript/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── paper.Rmd      # RMarkdown 论文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── renv.lock          # 依赖锁文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── README.md</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种结构确保了数据处理的每一步都有迹可循，任何人都能从原始数据开始完整复现所有分析结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>数据整理练习</strong>：使用 <code>dplyr</code> 和 <code>tidyr</code>，将一份包含 100 名被试、3 个时间点、2 个条件的重复测量数据从宽格式转换为长格式，并计算每个条件在每个时间点的均值和标准误。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>可视化挑战</strong>：使用 ggplot2 创建一张包含以下元素的图表：分组箱线图（boxplot）叠加散点抖动（jitter）、显著性标注、自定义配色方案。尝试让图表达到期刊发表的质量标准。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>混合模型实操</strong>：使用 <code>lme4</code> 包的 <code>sleepstudy</code> 数据集，拟合一个包含随机截距和随机斜率的线性混合模型，比较不同随机效应结构对模型拟合的影响（使用 AIC/BIC 比较）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>可重复研究</strong>：创建一份 RMarkdown 文档，包含至少一个数据读取步骤、一个统计模型、一张图表和一段结果解释。编译为 HTML 和 PDF 两种格式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>思考题</strong>：renv 解决了什么问题？如果你的合作者使用不同版本的 R 包，可能会导致哪些具体的分析差异？请举出至少两个真实场景。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Wickham &amp; Grolemund 《R for Data Science》</strong>（<a href=\"https://r4ds.hadley.nz/）：tidyverse\">https://r4ds.hadley.nz/）：tidyverse</a> 官方教程，免费在线阅读，从零开始系统学习现代 R 数据科学</li>\n<li><strong>Wickham 《ggplot2: Elegant Graphics for Data Analysis》</strong>：ggplot2 的理论基础和高级用法，理解图形语法的精髓</li>\n<li><strong>Bates et al. &quot;Fitting Linear Mixed-Effects Models Using lme4&quot;</strong>（Journal of Statistical Software, 2015）：lme4 包的官方论文，详解混合效应模型的数学基础和实现</li>\n<li><strong>Rosseel &quot;lavaan: An R Package for Structural Equation Modeling&quot;</strong>（Journal of Statistical Software, 2012）：lavaan 的设计理念与实战指南</li>\n<li><strong>Bürkner &quot;brms: An R Package for Bayesian Multilevel Models Using Stan&quot;</strong>（Journal of Statistical Software, 2017）：贝叶斯建模的入门必读</li>\n<li><strong>Bioconductor 官方网站</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.bioconductor.org/）：如果你从事生物医学研究，这里有最全面的生物信息学\">https://www.bioconductor.org/）：如果你从事生物医学研究，这里有最全面的生物信息学</a> R 工具链</li>\n<li><strong>R-bloggers</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.r-bloggers.com/）：聚合了数百位\">https://www.r-bloggers.com/）：聚合了数百位</a> R 开发者的博客，紧跟最新的方法和包</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>R 语言的核心优势在于其无与伦比的统计生态和科研社区支持。本节覆盖了研究生阶段最常用的 R 技能栈：tidyverse 负责数据整理和转换，ggplot2 负责高质量可视化，lme4/lavaan/brms 覆盖了从频率学派到贝叶斯学派的主流统计模型，RMarkdown 实现了分析与写作的一体化，renv 则确保了项目的长期可复现性。</p>\n<p>建议的学习路径：先熟练掌握 tidyverse 的数据操作流程（这是一切分析的基础），再根据自己的研究方向选择对应的建模工具（心理学/教育学常用 lme4 和 lavaan，生态学/流行病学常用 brms），最后养成使用 RMarkdown + renv 的习惯，让每一份分析报告都能被未来的自己和合作者完整复现。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 科研统计方法 — R 语言科研应用","id":"研究生-科研统计方法-r-语言科研应用"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"R 生态系统全景","id":"r-生态系统全景"},{"level":3,"text":"tidyverse 数据整理流","id":"tidyverse-数据整理流"},{"level":3,"text":"ggplot2 可视化语法","id":"ggplot2-可视化语法"},{"level":3,"text":"关键统计建模包","id":"关键统计建模包"},{"level":3,"text":"RMarkdown 可重复研究","id":"rmarkdown-可重复研究"},{"level":3,"text":"renv 包管理","id":"renv-包管理"},{"level":3,"text":"常见科研工作流模式","id":"常见科研工作流模式"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 贝叶斯推断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/advanced-methods/bayesian-inference"},"next":{"title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — Python 科学计算与统计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/software-tools/python-scipy-stats"}}